  "description": "This Coffee lover Sticker SVG Bundle is perfect for your crafting projects. This inspirational and positive quote can be used for t-shirts, mugs, tumblers, scrapbooking, frames, totes, or even stickers.\nYou can use this with the Silhouette Cutting Machines, Cricut, or other software that works with this type of file.\nYou will receive 1 zip file including:\n18 SVG file\n18 EPS file\n18 PNG file (high resolution and transparent background)\n18 DXF file\n*Note:\n– Actual colors may vary slightly due to monitor settings. Depending on how you choose to print out the image, colors, and quality may vary.\n– You will need a computer to unzip these files and a design/editing program that supports SVG/EPS/PNG/DXF file formats to use them.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This Coffee lover Sticker SVG Bundle is perfect for your crafting projects. This inspirational and positive quote can be used for t-shirts, mugs, tumblers, scrapbooking, frames, totes, or even stickers.</p>\n<p>You can use this with the Silhouette Cutting Machines, Cricut, or other software that works with this type of file.</p>\n<p>You will receive 1 zip file including:<br>\n18 SVG file<br>\n18 EPS file<br>\n18 PNG file (high resolution and transparent background)<br>\n18 DXF file</p>\n<p>*Note:<br>\n– Actual colors may vary slightly due to monitor settings. Depending on how you choose to print out the image, colors, and quality may vary.<br>\n– You will need a computer to unzip these files and a design/editing program that supports SVG/EPS/PNG/DXF file formats to use them.</p>",
